---
alwaysApply: true
---
When using `/fix-ticket` or SmartDeveloper subagents (`@triage`, `@context`, `@plan`,
`@dev`, `@test`, `@review`, `@docs-pr`, `@pr-fix`), ticket state lives in
`.dev-agent/{ticket-id}/` (`pipeline.json` plus numbered artifacts) in the **current
project workspace**.

Agents always read prior-stage files before starting their stage, and never skip
ahead to a later stage's file. Never proceed past a human gate without explicit
go-ahead in the conversation. The plan gate (stage 3) and the PR gate (stage 7) are
required, not optional, regardless of ticket size.

After each subagent finishes, stop and wait for engineer go-ahead before invoking the
next stage.
